        <item>
            <title>0.2.32</title>
            <pubDate>Fri, 23 Oct 2026 16:35:33 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>520</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.2.32</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Changes since v0.2.31:

- The 1.5-second quiet time after typing or a click is defined in the core library and pinned by a test (#186)
- Gotchas: link previews are cached by address, and Slack picks the layout (#181)
- The README hero hands use the deeper skin of the current 3D scene (ENS-117) (#180)
- CodeQL runs on pull requests only when the Swift sources or package files change (#175)
- The website's link preview carries the full tag set and an oEmbed photo for Slack (#179)
- All four Claude windows on the home page show grey placeholder bars, and none shows Plan mode, Opus or Auto-accept off (#178)
- The link preview image has a new address so validators stop showing the cached old one (#177)
]]></description>
